      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Visitors to the 1916 home see candid photographs, vehicles, and farm buildings that illustrate Rayburn’s personal life and political achievements.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://thc.texas.gov/state-historic-sites/sam-rayburn-house/plan-your-visit-sam-rayburn-house",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Sam Rayburn House is a National Historic Landmark, preserving the legacy of one of Texas’s most influential legislators.",
