      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sam_Rayburn",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sam Rayburn Reservoir, constructed beginning in 1956, was renamed in 1963 to honor the former Speaker’s impact on Texas water resources.",
